{"sha": "315a8e934201b60fef892c41fc5a0f2930594bb0918a728e4dd4793918764c64", "body": ["\\chapter{颜色与吸光度}\\label{ch:g11:absorbance}", "", "一瓶运动饮料在健身房的长凳上闪着鲜亮的蓝色。它的", "颜色来自溶于其中的染料，整升饮料里只有几毫克，", "少得几乎无法称量，也远不足以作为固体被看见。", "然而食品实验室必须检测这一含量，因为染料只能", "在限量之内添加。颜色本身正是关键：溶液中", "染料越多，溶液吸收的光就越多；能够测量溶液吸光多少的仪器，", "实际上测得的就是浓度。", "", "\\begin{recall}", "溶液的质量浓度与物质的量浓度；稀释母液；", "标准溶液的标准色阶，并与未知溶液比较", "（见\\cref{ch:g10:concentration-and-dilution}）", "\\end{recall}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.5\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g11-sports-drink.jpg}", "", "{\\small 一瓶蓝色饮料，其颜色来自每升饮料中的", "几毫克染料。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{溶液的颜色}", "", "白光（如日光）是彩虹中所有颜色的", "混合。每种颜色对应一个波长，紫光约", "为 \\qty{400}{nm}，红光约为 \\qty{750}{nm}；物理课本解释了", "什么是波长，这里它只是颜色的一个标签。有色溶液会吸收", "穿过它的部分光线，且对不同颜色的吸收差异很大；人眼", "看到的是", "透过的颜色。", "", "\\begin{definition}[互补色]\\label{def:g11:absorbance:complementary}", "若两种颜色混合后可得白光，则称它们为\\emph{互补色}\\index{互补色}。", "在色轮上，互补色", "彼此相对。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\foreach \\a/\\c/\\n/\\w/\\t in {90/red!85!black/red/{620--750}/white,", "      30/orange/orange/{590--620}/black, -30/yellow!90!orange/yellow/{570--590}/black,", "      -90/green!70!black/green/{500--570}/white, -150/cyan!50!blue/blue/{450--500}/white,", "      150/violet!80!blue/violet/{400--450}/white} {", "    \\fill[\\c] (0,0) -- (\\a-30:1.8) arc[start angle=\\a-30, end angle=\\a+30,", "      radius=1.8] -- cycle;", "    \\node[text=\\t, font=\\small\\bfseries] at (\\a:1.2) {\\n};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize, align=center] at (\\a:2.45) {\\w\\\\ nm};", "  }", "  \\fill[white] (0,0) circle (0.45);", "  \\draw[<->, thick, black!70] (90:0.5) -- (-90:0.5);", "  \\draw[<->, thick, black!70] (30:0.5) -- (-150:0.5);", "  \\draw[<->, thick, black!70] (-30:0.5) -- (150:0.5);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 色轮，标出了近似波长。互补色", "彼此相对：红色与绿色、橙色与蓝色、黄色与", "紫色。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[看到的颜色]\\label{prop:g11:absorbance:colour-seen}", "若某溶液主要吸收白光中的某一种颜色，", "则它呈现的颜色是与之互补的颜色。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在本阶段不加证明地承认：透过的光是白光减去被吸收的", "那种颜色后的剩余光，人眼将其看作互补色。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[两种食品染料]\\label{ex:g11:absorbance:dyes}", "% ledger: lmax:E133, lmax:E102", "运动饮料中的蓝色染料即亮蓝（E133），", "主要吸收橙红色光，波长约为 \\qty{629}{nm}，因此呈现蓝色。", "黄色染料柠檬黄（E102）主要吸收紫蓝色光，波长约为", "\\qty{427}{nm}，因此呈现黄色。绿色饮料通常两者都含有。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{吸收光谱}", "", "\\begin{definition}[吸收光谱]\\label{def:g11:absorbance:spectrum}", "溶液的\\emph{吸收光谱}\\index{吸收光谱}是", "溶液所吸收的光（即其吸光度，定义见下一节）", "随波长变化的图像。使吸收最大的", "波长记为 $\\lambda_{\\max}$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.85\\linewidth, height=6cm, xmin=380, xmax=750,", "    ymin=0, ymax=0.95, xlabel={波长 $\\lambda$ (\\si{nm})},", "    ylabel={吸光度 $A$}, axis lines*=left, ymajorgrids,", "    grid style={gray!20}, tick label style={font=\\small},", "    label style={font=\\small}, xtick={400,450,500,550,600,650,700,750},", "    ]", "  % ledger: lmax:E133, abs:E133, lmax:E102, abs:E102 (band shapes synthetic)", "  \\addplot[very thick, cyan!60!blue] table[x=lambda, y=E133]", "    {figdata/out/grade-11-absorbance-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[very thick, orange!85!yellow] table[x=lambda, y=E102]", "    {figdata/out/grade-11-absorbance-a.dat};", "  \\node[font=\\small, align=left, anchor=west, text=cyan!60!blue!80!black]", "    at (axis cs:668,0.62) {蓝色染料 E133,\\\\ \\qty{5.0}{mg/L}};", "  \\node[font=\\small, align=left, anchor=west, text=orange!80!black]", "    at (axis cs:470,0.66) {黄色染料 E102,\\\\ \\qty{15}{mg/L}};", "  \\addplot[dashed, black!50] coordinates {(629,0) (629,0.82)};", "  \\addplot[dashed, black!50] coordinates {(427,0) (427,0.795)};", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:629,0.83) {\\qty{629}{nm}};", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:427,0.81) {\\qty{427}{nm}};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}